OL,3,GNEWSAHockey legends back on the ice to
OL,4,Amark anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FIce hockey legends who have not skated
OL,7,Fin years are taking on the Swindon
OL,8,FWildcats team, to mark 40 years of ice
OL,9,Fhockey in the town.
OL,11,FThe Wildcats, Wiltshire's only ice
OL,12,Fhockey team, was founded in 1986 by
OL,13,Ffive players from the North East
OL,14,Fshortly after the opening of the town's
OL,15,FLink Centre.
OL,17,FTo mark the club's 40th anniversary, a
OL,18,Fteam of former players are lacing up
OL,19,Ftheir skates again to face the current
OL,20,F2026/27 roster in a "one-of-a-kind"
OL,21,Fmatch on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
