OL,3,GNEWSAHockey legends back on the ice to
OL,4,Amark anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteve Nell, managing director, said:
OL,7,F"When I asked [the legends], everybody
OL,8,Fwas: 'yes'. Now some of them are out
OL,9,Fthere and it's a little bit tougher -
OL,10,F[they're] stiff and haven't skated for
OL,11,Fa long time but everybody will be fine
OL,12,Fon the day."
